          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most car campers, the EcoFlow WAVE 3 is the best portable air conditioner for a vehicle: real compressor cooling, heat for cold nights and a durable LiFePO4 battery. If space is tight, the Zero Breeze Mark 3 is nearly as capable in a smaller, lighter box, and the WAVE 2 on sale is the best value. Truck drivers should look at the Dometic RTX 2000, and van builders at the Velit 2000R.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
